nfocused. Returning to the game restores your current volume settings. Background idle progress is unaffected. Shortened some volume labels in several languages to make the audio settings clearer.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:22:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032425","verified_at":"2026-10-22T16:36:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4828800-1847286114031290","game_id":"steam-4828800","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.0.31 Update Notes","summary":"Added a Shop button to the bottom of the backpack for easier access to buying and selling. Split the Shop and Forge into separate windows that can stay open together. Buy and Sell are now in the Shop; Forge and Salvage are in the Forge window. Organizing your backpack or storage now automatically merges matching material stacks where stacking rules allow. Improved equipment messages to explain why an item cannot be equipped. Fixed display and crafting calculation issues involving large material ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:43:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031290","verified_at":"2026-10-22T05:59:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4828800-1844751498221742","game_id":"steam-4828800","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.0.28: Clearer Crafting, Skills & Window Controls","summary":"Thanks to everyone who has played the Alice's Desktop Adventure demo and shared feedback. Demo 1.0.28 is now live, with improvements to everyday actions and clearer information.• Dismantling and selling: Fixed an issue that prevented items from being dragged in. Drag a selected item back to your inventory or storage to cancel.• Equipment Workshop: The forging stone slot now shows 